        given-names: David B.
      - family-names: Wetzstein
        given-names: Gordon
    year: 2020
    journal: "Advances in Neural Information Processing Systems"
    volume: "33"
    doi: "10.48550/arXiv.2006.09661"
    url: "https://arxiv.org/abs/2006.09661"
    notes: >-
      SIREN architecture. The baseline in this repository is an independent
      reimplementation of the method, not a port of upstream SIREN source code.
  - type: software
    title: "TensorKrowch"
    authors:
